* fpdummy.a - no-op floating-point startup, for programs that do not use FP.
*
* crt0 unconditionally calls _fpinit / _fpterm; this is the link default that
* satisfies those calls when the program references no FP helpers, so it neither
* links the MC6839 FPO9 module nor requires it to be present.  Programs that use
* floating point pull in fpinit.a instead (with the FP helper wrappers).
 psect fpdummy_a,0,0,0,0,0

_fpinit:
 rts

_fpterm:
 rts

 endsect
